      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Designed to perform – for more patients&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Both devices are approved for adolescents and adults for up to 24 hours<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>and both provide a customizable fit that stays in place and diverts urine away from the skin to keep your patients comfortable.</span></p>\n",
