        "hideComponent": "false",
        "rightMargin": "5",
        "topMargin": "3",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">“</span></span>Easier to put on.<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">”</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">“</span></span>More convenient to use.<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">”</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">– Clinicians at an acute care hospital using<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">&nbsp;PrimoFit Flow</span></span><sup>7</sup>*<br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">*Disclaimer: Survey response in comparison to Sage PrimoFit+ External Urine Management for the Male Anatomy #5405.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
